See the per-function comments for the full contract.  The paint dispatch 47e0 -> 60d9 -> [0x690]
reaches 22bf with BX=0x3b4c (1d7f(0x58)) clip rect, SI=0x7ac0 source struct, DI=0x7aa4 dest struct;
