(clip rect, saved SI/DI slots, the two span-list segment bases) was modelled as pointer arithmetic
on one host local -> clip locals uninitialised + span cursors NULL.  Reconstructed frame-faithful.

Reached only by the in-mission display-list PAINT (the ACCEPT cascade), never by the 19 verify
flows -> behaviour-neutral (verify 19/19).  re_out/fist.c + fist_mga.c stay pristine (patch-only).

